stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    state "Working (never times out)" as Working
    state "Needs you" as NeedsYou
    state "Idle" as Idle
    state "Dead" as Dead
    state "Closed (resumable)" as Closed

    [*] --> Working : droid_start (subscribes by default)
    Working --> NeedsYou : asks permission or a question 🔔
    NeedsYou --> Working : droid_respond
    NeedsYou --> Working : 30 min unanswered, auto-cancelled
    Working --> Idle : turn finished 🔔
    Working --> Idle : droid_interrupt
    Idle --> Working : droid_send
    Working --> Dead : droid process exited
    NeedsYou --> Dead : droid process exited
    Idle --> Dead : droid process exited
    Dead --> Working : droid_send resumes it
    Working --> Closed : droid_close
    NeedsYou --> Closed : droid_close
    Idle --> Closed : droid_close, or 30 min idle (sessions droid_start started)
    Dead --> Closed : droid_close
    Closed --> Working : droid_send resumes it

    note right of NeedsYou
        🔔 a plugin ring. It wakes your agent
        only for subscribed sessions.
        droid_subscribe / droid_unsubscribe.
        droid_inbox still lists every ring.
    end note
